} Note: To use this policy with the aws:VpcSourceIP condition, you must attach a VPC endpoint for Amazon S3 . The VPC endpoint must be attached to the route table of the EC2 instance's subnet, and be in the same AWS Region as the bucket. The following example bucket policy blocks traffic to the bucket unless the request is from specified external IP addresses ( aws:SourceIp ): {
